              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Lena Byard"
            },
            "reviewBody": "My husband and I wanted to make this for ourselves but we didn’t want to use rum. Instead we used the whole 750ml bottle of courvoisier and the amount of orange and pineapple juice the recipe called for. We also didn’t use any other syrup than the grenadine. Boy, did we make one sneaky drink! Lol \nI can only imagine how much better it will taste after sitting in the fridge for a couple hours because that taste test was awesome.",
